menu "Yuguang BLE"
config YG_BLE_UNENCRYPTED_DEBUG
    bool "Allow unencrypted fixed-peer BLE debugging (unsafe)"
    default n
    help
        Skip pairing and bonding only for the Yuguang fixed-peer link.
        Data is not confidential and MAC addresses can be spoofed.
        Both boards must use the same mode. Disable for production.
endmenu
